  "input": "Dear sale-team.Hello!\nThis message come from anker.com ----RMA----,\nSource: amazon\nOrder No: Anker016\nProduct Name: eufy S1 Pro Wearbale Breast Pump\nProblem Description: I have been using this breast pump for less than three weeks and the left pump will no longer suction. It clicks but does not suction. Troubleshooting articles say it's a diaphragm issue but when I disassemble the pump to check, the diaphragm sits. I've only ever hand washed the pump parts. Now I have to wear the right pump on one breast and then switch it to the other. I'm very disappointed as I loved wearing this pump on the go.\nSubmit Date: 2026-09-27T10:47:59.871Z",
